# ── 原始素材 · Source material ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# 规则只有一条：_source/ 里的东西不上传，其余全部上传。
# One rule: nothing in _source/ is pushed; everything else is.
#
# _source/ 里是写网站用的原料，不是网站本身：PPT 与宣传册原件（企业介绍那份
# 274 MB，超过 GitHub 100 MB 单文件硬限）、logo 源文件、TAI 对比图原图。
# 网站运行不加载其中任何一个。新素材直接丢进 _source/ 即可，不用再改这个文件。
#
# It holds the raw material the site was built from — decks, original
# brochures (one is 274 MB, past GitHub's 100 MB limit), logo source files,
# full-size TAI images. The site loads none of it. Drop new material into
# _source/ and this file never needs editing again.
/_source/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# 根目录兜底 · Root-level catch-all
# 素材习惯性先落在根目录，只靠 /_source/ 挡不住——一份 48.9 MB 的 PDF 就是
# 这样被带进仓库的。根目录下的这些格式一律不跟踪；网站真正要用的文件都在
# assets/ 里，不受影响。
# Material tends to land at the repo root first, where /_source/ does not
# reach — that is how a 48.9 MB PDF got committed once. Nothing of these
# types at the root is tracked; everything the site actually serves lives
# under assets/ and is unaffected.
/*.pdf
/*.pptx
/*.ppt
/*.docx
/*.doc
/*.ai
/*.psd
/*.zip
